  "content": [
    {
      "text": "Lord is King for ever and ever, Ps. 10:16. Lord’s throne is in heaven, Ps. 11:4. Who is this King of glory? The Lord strong and mighty, Ps. 24:8. Lord sitteth King for ever, Ps. 29:10. Thy throne, O God, is for ever and ever, Ps. 45:6 (Heb. 1:8). God sitteth upon the throne of his holiness, Ps. 47:8. Holy One of Israel is our king, Ps. 89:18. Lord is a great God, and a great King, Ps. 95:3. Lord sitting upon a throne, high and lifted up, Isa. 6:1 (2 Ne. 16:1). Lord the King of Israel, Isa. 44:6. heaven is my throne, Isa. 66:1 (Acts 7:49). living God, and an everlasting king, Jer. 10:10.",
