    {
      "text": "Repent ye: for the kingdom of heaven is at hand, Matt. 3:2 (4:17). poor in spirit: for theirs is the kingdom of heaven, Matt. 5:3 (3 Ne. 12:3). see the Son of man coming in his kingdom, Matt. 16:28. inherit the kingdom prepared for you, Matt. 25:34. when I drink it new with you in my Father’s kingdom, Matt. 26:29 (Mark 14:25; Luke 22:18). kingdom of God is at hand, Mark 1:15. be ye poor: for yours is the kingdom of God, Luke 6:20. ye shall see … all the prophets, in the kingdom of God, Luke 13:28. I appoint unto you a kingdom, Luke 22:29. remember me when thou comest into thy kingdom, Luke 23:42. unrighteous shall not inherit the kingdom of God, 1 Cor. 6:9 (Gal. 5:21). flesh and blood cannot inherit the kingdom of God, 1 Cor. 15:50. translated us into the kingdom of his dear Son, Col. 1:13. heirs of the kingdom which he hath promised to them that love him, James 2:5.",
